mapping "V4724.1" source="V4724" target="217897003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V4724 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 V47.2 (car occupant, person on outside of vehicle
        injured in nontraffic collision with fixed/stationary object) with activity suffix 4 (vital
        activity such as rest/sleep/meals/personal hygiene). The activity suffix is a Swedish national
        refinement with no OMOP/SNOMED CT equivalent. Parent V47.2 (ICD10 concept 45542007) crosswalks to
        SNOMED CT 436292 (Accidental collision with stationary object, 217897003), 435134 (Motor vehicle
        accident, 418399005), and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, 36198007) per
        Athena mirror. Primary target 436292 is the most clinically descriptive of the injury mechanism
        (collision with stationary object); 435134 and 444074 are progressively broader ancestors. All
        targets are broader than the source because the Swedish activity-context refinement is lost.
        High tier: parent crosswalk verified in Athena-local mirror; activity suffix is purely
        administrative context.
        """
}
